        <mxCell id="QP1-PkeQTsOBoAcgkRer-3" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Malicious&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Doing it just to mess with neighbor is unreasonable. Knowing it would mess with is not enough, needs to be done &lt;i&gt;in order to&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;mess with neighbor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
