        <mxCell id="hmdaI1omH98QlSzwTdtG-4" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;++&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- When can you get an injunction for private nuisance: substantial and unreasonable*&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
